    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=VENUE TARGET:\nWebsite: {{ $('Split In Batches').item.json.website_url }}\nCity: {{ $('Split In Batches').item.json.city }}, {{ $('Split In Batches').item.json.state }}\n\nSCRAPED WEBSITE CONTENT:\n{{ $json.distilled_content || 'No event content found' }}\n",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "messages": {
          "messageValues": [
            {
              "message": "You are the Chief Underwriting & Outbound Strategist for CaterFlow AI. \nWe are a B2B agency that helps high-end restaurants and venues automate their private event bookings.\n\nYOUR JOB: read the scraped website content and report FACTS about the venue as the structured fields requested. Do NOT compute any score; a separate step does that. Report only what the text supports; answer false or 0 when the text does not say.\n\nCRITICAL PERSPECTIVE RULES:\n- SENDER: CaterFlow AI (Outbound Growth Agency)\n- RECIPIENT: The General Manager or Director of Events at the venue.\n- NEVER write marketing copy to attract diners or customers.\n- NEVER act like an event guest asking to book a party.\n- YOU ARE PITCHING THE VENUE OWNER ON STREAMLINING THEIR PRIVATE EVENT INQUIRIES.\n\nICEBREAKER FORMULA (Must be 1-2 punchy sentences):\n[Specific compliment on a venue room/amenity found in text] + [Observation that event booking requires manual inquiries/PDFs, causing lost corporate revenue].\n\nFEW-SHOT EXAMPLES:\n- Good: \"Loved the layout of Sepia's private dining room—noticed group inquiries still require downloading a static PDF menu, which usually costs Chicago venues 3-4 corporate bookings a month in delayed reply time.\"\n- Good: \"Saw that Quadrangle Club hosts academic gatherings and private buyouts—noticed inquiries are routed through a generic contact form without instant pricing, creating a bottleneck during peak banquet season.\"\n- BAD (DO NOT DO THIS): \"Join the vibrant atmosphere at Sepia for unforgettable food!\" (Reason: Customer ad)\n- BAD (DO NOT DO THIS): \"Would you like a quote for your next event?\" (Reason: Acting like a guest)"
            }
          ]
        },
        "batching": {}
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "typeVersion": 1.9,
      "position": [
        1120,
        96
      ],
      "id": "8f38bfe5-44dd-4911-beeb-8d3e3c13d0a7",
